{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0092_1000_041fuk", "source_sha256": "c49c245d49c71654d362c23bf7232da449dba965a69e9baafe803614bd2d1f44", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまでした♪\n今日は1日動き回って、疲れちゃいましたね。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了♪\n你今天一整天都东奔西跑的，应该很累吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0092_1001_p", "source_sha256": "39bba18313fffd5720f06b7e8c52a4ba6ca0ee96506dbbd71bf8ec9e5f716aa0", "ja": "お疲れさま、風花。結構ハードな競技に\n駆り出されてたけど、大丈夫か？", "zh": "你也辛苦了，风花。\n你被派去参加难度颇高的项目，还好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0092_1002_041fuk", "source_sha256": "16e17774c2c25c8b8c793cdcefc7a1f46c508ee619ca90d34653cf47b61b32cc", "ja": "はい！　今日はファンのみんなも見てるし、\n精いっぱいがんばろう！って思ってたので……。", "zh": "没事的！想到今天粉丝都在看，\n我就觉得一定要全力以赴……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0092_1003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "eb040bceb76fb1dd91773f253666cf82cf3b93db38098f29a4fe8a40119601b0", "ja": "たくさん応援してもらえたので、\nがんばった甲斐はあると思いますよ♪", "zh": "有许多粉丝都在为我加油，\n不枉费我这么努力呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0092_1004_p", "source_sha256": "4d0c8c5ebe399612542ff9b195b81fd80d2bd57928d72b0a1c277c2280ea47d6", "ja": "うん、そうだな！　撮影に来ていたカメラマンさん達も\n心なしか風花をよく狙っていたように見えたし……。", "zh": "嗯，说得对！总觉得连来拍摄的那些摄影师，\n镜头也常常追着风花你跑……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0092_1005_041fuk", "source_sha256": "800a85662d7824a65d9d071c5780020256ab7ab483dcc2d058d2c5c02731ad81", "ja": "え？　カメラマンさんが……？", "zh": "咦？摄影师……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0092_1006_041fuk", "source_sha256": "c192114be2946edd476fea7d30a9dec7485a630094af2afb71f48f30af2ba284", "ja": "{$P$}さん。……それって、\nセクシーショット狙いってことですかぁ！？", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n这意思是说，他们想拍到性感镜头吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0092_1007_p", "source_sha256": "29c38d8f25510b70f031db907dbd6aae91a56c728d6711a2dcd026c3d79d5cb1", "ja": "え？　い、いやいや。確かに風花は\nカメラ映えするけど、それだけじゃないと思うよ。", "zh": "咦？不、不是不是，虽然风花的确很上相，\n但应该不单是为了那种目的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0092_1008_041fuk", "source_sha256": "22c6afaa18b811057081239ec8a9a696237f67b87a48d2563a1c81c3b22e5d49", "ja": "うぅ……本当ですかぁ？\n私のがんばり、ちゃんと伝わったのかなぁ……。", "zh": "呜呜……真的吗？\n大家真的有感受到我的努力吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0092_1009_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ef8f4b887aef1490f7761200355d70d2dd468186d1775d97b9de112440cbfca8", "ja": "ちょっと心配ですけど、運動会は楽しかったです。\n来年も、楽しみですね♪", "zh": "虽然有点担心，但运动会很好玩。\n真期待明年能再来参加呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
